WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.200
Who goes there?

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.200
What business do you have here?

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.600
We came to protect the village.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.700
Please, trust us.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.000
The village?

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.600
That village already burned down.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.700
No... You're lying, right?

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.000
Where did everyone go?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.100
The survivors fled beyond the mountains.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.700
Hurry, before nightfall.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.400
Understood.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.500
Let's go together!
